msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Nintendo - Game Boy / Color (SameBoy)"
msgstr "Nintendo - Game Boy / Color (SameBoy)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid ""
"SameBoy is an open source Gameboy (DMG) and Gameboy Color (CGB) emulator, "
"written in portable C."
msgstr "SameBoy är en Gameboy (DMG)- och Gameboy Color (CGB)-emulator med öppen källkod, skriven i portabel C."

