"Boy Color games on Game Boy #2."
msgstr "Anger vilken typ av färgkorrigering som ska tillämpas vid spel av Game Boy Color-spel på Game Boy 2."

msgctxt "#30097"
msgid ""
"Simulates an ambient light's effect on non-backlit Game Boy screens, by "
"setting a user-controlled color temperature applied to the screen of Game "
"Boy #1. This option has no effect if the content is run on an original Game "
"Boy (DMG) emulated model."
